@startuml
actor Operator
participant "MES Frontend" as frontend
participant "MES API" as api
participant "Redis Cache" as cache
participant "MES DB" as db
participant "Message Queue" as mq

title Обновление статуса заказа и инвалидация кеша

Operator -> frontend: Меняет статус заказа #123 на "completed"
frontend -> api: PUT /orders/123/status
api -> db: UPDATE orders SET status = 'completed' WHERE id = 123
db --> api: OK
api -> cache: DEL orders:status:in_progress
api -> cache: DEL orders:status:completed
api -> mq: Отправляет сообщение "order.status.updated"
api --> frontend: Статус обновлён
frontend --> Operator: Статус изменён
@enduml